<title>UK: Deutsche Finance sets 500 mln mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Finance sets 500 mln mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsce Morgan Grenfell</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    24.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.275    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
